      "lineAnnotations": {
        "0": {
          "synopsis": "VTII PT3 Player (Vortex Tracker II).\n$8000 holds LD HL with the default module address, so the three-byte\nentry points follow at $8003 (init, HL = module) and $8005 (play once\nper frame). MusicInit and MusicPlay in bank 5 call those."
        },
        "3": {
          "comment": "Init entry: HL = module address"
        },
        "5": {
          "comment": "Play entry: call once per frame"
        },
        "2195": {
          "synopsis": "PT3 module \"Goddy\" by karbofos [dlcorp][3umph].\nThe AY 2 half of a TurboSound pair; the other chip plays its own\narrangement of the same tune from the neighbouring bank.\n3895 bytes ($0F37), $8893-$97C9. Header text is 99 bytes,\nthen TonTableId/Delay/Positions/Loop, the pointer table, the position\nlist and the pattern, sample and ornament data."
        },
        "2298": {
          "synopsis": "Pointer table: PatternsPointer, then 32 sample and 16 ornament\npointers. 49 words, each an offset from the module's first byte."
        },
        "6088": {
          "comment": "Module tail, shown as a word so the next module starts a row"
        },
        "6090": {
          "synopsis": "PT3 module \"xray speculation\" by Gasman (mixTS by Voxel_3umf).\nThe AY 2 half of a TurboSound pair; the other chip plays its own\narrangement of the same tune from the neighbouring bank.\n4041 bytes ($0FC9), $97CA-$A792. Header text is 99 bytes,\nthen TonTableId/Delay/Positions/Loop, the pointer table, the position\nlist and the pattern, sample and ornament data."
        },
        "6193": {
          "synopsis": "Pointer table: PatternsPointer, then 32 sample and 16 ornament\npointers. 49 words, each an offset from the module's first byte."
        }
      }
    },
